    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check the Workshop!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a ton of great mods in the Steam Workshop, including new campaigns, holdout maps, player skins, player hats, and emotes!<br><br>And now with New Enemies, Grenades, and Weapons!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle for survival against endless alien hordes with your friends!  The Anacrusis is a 1-8 player, sci-fi first-person shooter. Experience intense 4 player co-op action or play as the aliens and stop your friends in Versus mode. Make sure to check out the Steam Workshop support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With our new update out, we are currently out of sync with Xbox players, if you want to cross play go into the steam setting for the game and enter XBOX in the beta password.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even with this massive update - we want to acknowledge for anyone buying this today, the community online is small.\u00a0 <br><br>You most likely will not find many active games online to match into but - it's a great game to play with your friends, solo or join our community where there are always people looking for games along with regular game nights, mod testing and more.  <br><br>Fight Aliens Using Fantastical Weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/10cfef81b6f2b994d8e08fa0e8ef0ec5.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>Battle the alien menace using an astounding arsenal of classic sci-fi weapons. Buy yourself some time with a stasis grenade, toss a shield grenade to provide instant cover while you pop off a heal, and bring your friends back to life using the Respawner. Or throw caution to the wind and burn friend and foe alike with the laser rifle.<br><br>  Join the Ultra Violence beta to check out brand new crazy weapons... want to kill everything all at once!?!? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play As The Aliens in PVP Versus Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/734e1dc051a83a25df8dfa0d361da09e.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>PVP comes to The Anacrusis! The goals are simple, Survivors need to reach the end of the level and the Aliens must keep them from their goal. Take control of the Brute, Flasher, Grabber, Gooper, and Spawner and keep your friends from escaping the level. Tuned for intense co-op PVP play with teams of 2, 3, or 4 players, or take on the bots in a private match to practice playing the aliens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive the Alien Infestation!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/4351cf452b8c558d80a4495b8390742b.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>In the distant future, mighty corporations have carried humanity to the fringes of the galaxy. After expanding unfettered across tens of thousands of systems--all devoid of intelligent life--humanity has grown complacent, until disaster strikes. Work together and survive the alien hordes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Fight For Survival Is Just the Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/4f05a7c93bdd177c32e2b8f991526e1a.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>The first season of The Anacrusis tells the story of four unlikely survivors--Nessa, Guion, Liu, and Lance--who are unwilling combatants in the battle to defend humanity from the alien menace. Play more and unlock more of the unfolding mystery of the alien attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Never Fight the Same Battle Twice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/07e76d7fbf59d6cc4ba39ccf06018d39.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>In The Anacrusis, the AI Driver controls every aspect of the game. It spawns every enemy, directs each boss, and places every weapon, gadget, and health kit. No matter your skill level, you'll find the perfect level of challenge. More than that, the AI Driver creates the kinds of video game moments that you can\u2019t wait to tell your friends about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/e40e7b67285d934bbb06f97b58d67f6d.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've posted over 60 updates to The Anacrusis since launch, and we couldn't have done it without our incredible community of Early Access players.  and share your feedback with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">We Love Mods! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/5e8db46cb499cdbb48222c2d15187589.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>We think co-op games are better with mods, which is why The Anacrusis includes Steam Workshop support for new campaigns, holdout maps, character skins, character accessories, gun charms, and animations, with more to come. Even better, the mods you load are automatically displayed for your friends to see when you play the game. Want to create mods for The Anacrusis? Join our Discord -  for updates and conversation about mod support. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn New Perks and Change the Way You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/a2ff9421cded406bfbb0b623d7e901ff.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>Matter compilers spread throughout the game give you access to dozens of perks that will change the way you play. Stack all of your upgrades to power up the last-resort pistol or boost your defense by supercharging your shield pulse. Unlock new perks as you play, and share your unlocks with everyone on your team!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle for survival against endless alien hordes with your friends!  The Anacrusis is a 1-8 player, sci-fi first-person shooter. Experience intense 4 player co-op action or play as the aliens and stop your friends in Versus mode. Make sure to check out the Steam Workshop support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With our new update out, we are currently out of sync with Xbox players, if you want to cross play go into the steam setting for the game and enter XBOX in the beta password.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even with this massive update - we want to acknowledge for anyone buying this today, the community online is small.\u00a0 <br><br>You most likely will not find many active games online to match into but - it's a great game to play with your friends, solo or join our community where there are always people looking for games along with regular game nights, mod testing and more.  <br><br>Fight Aliens Using Fantastical Weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/10cfef81b6f2b994d8e08fa0e8ef0ec5.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>Battle the alien menace using an astounding arsenal of classic sci-fi weapons. Buy yourself some time with a stasis grenade, toss a shield grenade to provide instant cover while you pop off a heal, and bring your friends back to life using the Respawner. Or throw caution to the wind and burn friend and foe alike with the laser rifle.<br><br>  Join the Ultra Violence beta to check out brand new crazy weapons... want to kill everything all at once!?!? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play As The Aliens in PVP Versus Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120480/extras/734e1dc051a83a25df8dfa0d361da09e.avif?t=1750913618\" /></div>PVP come